<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Tessenderlo H1 profit down 29%.</title>
<headline>Belgian Tessenderlo H1 profit down 29%.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			   1.32 vs     1.86</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			    25.44 vs    25.57</p>
<p>Note - Tessenderlo SA is a Belgian chemicals company  </p>
<p>    Cons current pretax profit	    1.92 vs     2.51</p>
<p>    Cons net cash flow			3.13 vs     3.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Tessenderlo said profit data were not audited. It also said that the first half of 1995 had been exceptionally favourable for the group.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
